SUMMARY:Society of Biological Psychiatry 82nd Annual Meeting 2027
DESCRIPTION:The 2027 SOBP Annual Meeting takes place May 6 to 8\, 2027\, 
 in Chicago under the theme The Metabolic Brain. Travel fellowship applic
 ations for the meeting close October 5\, 2026\; the oral and poster abst
 ract deadline has not been posted on the society site as of September 20
 26.\n\nDeadlines\nTravel fellowship application (predoctoral\, early car
 eer North American\, early career international): 2026-10-05\nSymposium 
 proposal submission: 2026-09-25 (estimated)\nHonorific award nominations
 : 2026-10-23 (estimated)\nOral and poster abstract submission: 2026-12-0
 4 (estimated)\nLate breaking poster abstract submission: 2027-02-12 (est
 imated)\n\nhttps://sobp.org/sobp-annual-meeting/
LOCATION:Chicago\, Illinois\, Sheraton Grand Chicago Riverwalk
URL:https://sobp.org/sobp-annual-meeting/
